    "Eka nowacho niya, “Kaka ing’eyo, pinyruoth ne mara. Jo-Israel duto nong’iya kaka ruodhgi. To gik moko nolokore ma pinyruoth nodok ni owadwa; nimar Jehova Nyasaye ema osemiyego.",
    "Koro an gi kwayo achiel madwaro kwayo. Ka iyie to kik itama.” Bathsheba nowachone niya, “Wachi.”",
    "Eka Adonija nomedo wacho niya, “Yie ikwa ruoth Solomon omiya Abishag nyar Shunam obed jaoda nikech ang’eyo ni ok obi tami.”",
    "Bathsheba to ne odwoke niya, “Mano ber, abiro wuoyoni gi ruoth.”",
    "Kane Bathsheba odhi ir Ruoth Solomon mondo owuo kuom Adonija, ruoth nochung’ malo mokulorene eka nobet e kome mar duong’. Nokwayo mondo okel ni min-gi kom duong’ eka nobet e bade korachwich.",
    "Bathsheba nowachone niya, “An-gi kwayo matin madwaro kwayo to yie kik itama.” Ruoth to nodwoke niya, “Kwaye akwaya minwa nimar ok anatami.”",
    "Omiyo nowacho niya, “Yie iwe Abishag nyar Shunam mondo okend gi owadu Adonija.”",
    "Ruoth Solomon nodwoko min niya, “Ang’o momiyo ikwayo Abishag nyar Shunam ni Adonija? Inyalo anyala kata mana kwayone pinyruoth nimar en owadwa maduong’, bende inyalo kwaye ni Abiathar jadolo kod Joab wuod Zeruya!”",
    "Eka Ruoth Solomon nokwong’ore gi nying Jehova Nyasaye niya, “Mad Nyasaye kweda ka Adonija ok otho nikech kwayoni.",
    "Akwong’ora gi nying Jehova Nyasaye mangima ni en mosegura e kom loch mar Daudi wuora kendo mosesingo ni nyikwaya pinyruoth ni Adonija nyaka negi kawuono!”",
    "Omiyo Ruoth Solomon nochiwo chik ne Benaya wuod Jehoyada, mi nonego Adonija.",
    "To kuom Abiathar jadolo, ruoth nowacho niya, “Dog e puotheni mantie Anathoth. Iwinjori gi tho, to ok ananegi sani, nikech niting’o Sandug Muma mar Jehova Nyasaye Manyalo Gik Moko Duto e nyim Daudi wuonwa kendo nineno chandruok duto mane wuonwa oneno.”",
    "Omiyo Solomon nogolo Abiathar e tich dolo mar Jehova Nyasaye kochopogo wach mane Jehova Nyasaye owacho Shilo kuom od Eli.",
    "Kane wechego olandore mochopo ni Joab mane joriwore gi Adonija kata obedo ni ne ok oriwore gi Abisalom, ne oringo modhi e Hemb Jehova Nyasaye mi nomako tunge kendo mar misango.",
    "Ruoth Solomon nowachne ni Joab oseringo modhi e hemb Jehova Nyasaye kendo ni ne en but kendo mar misango. Eka Solomon nochiko Benaya wuod Jehoyada niya, “Dhiyo mondo inege.”",
    "Omiyo Benaya nodonjo e Hemb Jehova Nyasaye kendo nowacho ni Joab niya, “Ruoth wacho ni, ‘Wuog oko!’ ” To nodwoke niya, “Ooyo, abiro mana tho ka.” Benaya nodwoko wach Joab ni ruoth.",
    "Eka ruoth nochiko Benaya niya, “Tim kaka osewacho. Nege kendo yike mondo ipwodha kod od wuonwa kuom richo mar remo makare mane Joab ochwero.",
    "Jehova Nyasaye enochule kuom remo mane ochwero, nikech nonego ji ariyo gi ligangla ka wuonwa Daudi kia. Nonego Abner wuod Ner jatend lweny mar Israel kod Amasa wuod Jetha jatend lweny mar Juda mane gin joma ber kendo mobidhore moloye.",
    "Mad rembgi obedi ewi Joab gi nyikwaye nyaka chieng’. To kuom Daudi gi nyikwaye gi ode kod kuom lochne, mad kwe Jehova Nyasaye obedie nyaka chieng’.”",
    "Omiyo Benaya wuod Jehoyada nodhi monego Joab kendo noyike mana e lope e thim.",
    "Ruoth noketo Benaya wuod Jehoyada jatend lweny kar Joab mi noketo Zadok jadolo kar Abiathar jadolo.",
    "Eka ruoth noluongo Shimei ire, mowachone niya, ger ot Jerusalem mondo idagie to kik iwuogi ni idhi kamoro amora.",
    "Chieng’ ma iniwuogi ma ing’adi Holo mar Kidron, to bed gadiera ni initho; kendo rembi enobed e wiyi.",
    "To Shimei nodwoko ruoth niya, “Gima iwacho ber, jatichni biro timo kaka ruodhe osewacho.” Shimei nodak Jerusalem kuom ndalo mang’eny.",
    "To bang’ higni adek jotich Shimei ariyo noringo modhi ir Akish wuod Maaka, ruodh Gath kendo nowach ne Shimei niya, “Wasumbinigi ni Gath.”",
    "Gikanyono noidho pundane kendo nodhi ir Akish kane en Gath komanyo wasumbinige, omiyo Shimei nodhi moduogogi.",
    "Kane onyis Solomon ni Shimei nowuok Jerusalem modhi nyaka Gath kendo odwogo,",
    "ruoth noluongo Shimei mowachone niya, “Donge ne akwong’ora gi nying Jehova Nyasaye ka asiemi ni chieng’ ma iniwuogi mondo idhi kamoro amora to ibed king’eyo ni initho? To e kindeno niwachona niya, ‘Gima iwacho ber, abiro luwo.’",
    "Ang’o momiyo ne ok irito singruokni ni Jehova Nyasaye kendo rito chik mane amiyi?”",
    "Ruoth nomedo wachone Shimei niya, “Ing’eyo e chunyi richo duto mane itimone wuonwa Daudi. Koro Jehova Nyasaye biro chuli kuom richo duto mane itimo.",
    "To Ruoth Solomon ibiro gwedhi kendo kom loch mar Daudi biro siko kogurore e nyim Jehova Nyasaye nyaka chieng’.”",
    "Eka ruoth nogolo chik ni Benaya wuod Jehoyada, mi nowuok modhi mogoyo Shimei monege. Pinyruoth koro nogurore e lwet Solomon.",
