    "Ruoth nodhi Gibeon mondo ochiw misengini nimar kanyo e kama noting’ore malo moloyo ahinya kendo Solomon nochiwo misengini miwang’o pep alufu achiel e kendo mar misangono.",
    "E Gibeon kanyo ema Jehova Nyasaye nofwenyore ni Solomon gotieno e lek kendo Nyasaye nowachone niya, “Kwa gimoro amora midwaro ni mondo amiyi.”",
    "Solomon nodwoko niya, “Isenyiso ng’wono maduong’ ni jatichni Daudi wuonwa nikech ne en ja-adiera kuomi kendo ne en ng’ama kare ma chunye odimbore. Bende pod inyise ng’wono maduong’no nyaka chil kawuono kendo isemiye wuowi mondo obedi e kome kawuononi.",
    "“Koro, yaye Jehova Nyasaye, ma Nyasacha, iseketo jatichni ruoth kar wuonwa Daudi. To an mana rawera kendo ok ang’eyo kaka onego atim tichna.",
    "Jatichni nitie ka e kind oganda miseyiero, oganda maduong’ kendo mathoth mokalo akwana.",
    "Omiyo mi jatichni chuny mariek mondo otel ne jogi kendo mar pogo ber gi rach. Nimar en ng’a manyalo telo ni oganda maduong’ machalo kama?”",
    "Jehova Nyasaye ne mor ni Solomon nokwayo mano.",
    "Omiyo Nyasaye nowachone niya, “Nikech isekwayo mana ma to ok ikwayo ngima mathoth kata mwandu ni in iwuon, bende ok isekwayo tho mar wasiki to isekwayo mana rieko kuom ng’ado bura kare,",
    "Abiro timo gima isekwayo. Abiro miyi chuny mar rieko kod mar ng’eyo mondo kik bedie ng’ama chalo kodi kendo nyaka chieng’.",
    "Moloyo mano abiro miyi nyaka mago ma ok ikwayo kaka mwandu kod duong’ mondo e kinde mag ngimani ok inibed gi ng’at maromo kodi e kind ruodhi.",
    "To kiwuotho e yorena kendo rito buchena kod chikena kaka Daudi wuonu notimo bende anamiyi idak aming’a.”",
    "Bang’e Solomon nochiewo moyudo ni ne en mana lek. Nodok Jerusalem mochung’ e nyim Sandug Muma mar Singruok mar Jehova Nyasaye kendo nochiwo misango miwang’o pep kod misango mag lalruok. Eka notimo nyasi ni joge duto manie dala mar ruoth.",
    "Chieng’ moro mon ariyo ma jochode nobiro ir ruoth mochung’ e nyime.",
    "Achiel kuomgi nowacho niya, “Ruodha, dhakoni gi an wadak e ot chiel. Ne ayudo nyathi kane en koda e ot.",
    "Chieng’ mar adek kasenywolo nyathina, dhakoni bende noyudo nyathi. To ne onge ng’ato moro amora e ot makmana wan kendwa.",
    "“Gotieno wuod dhakoni notho nikech nonindo kuome.",
    "Omiyo nochung’ malo chuny otieno kendo okaw wuoda e batha ka jatichni ne nindo. Nokete e kore to okawo wuode mothono oketo e kora.",
    "Kinyne gokinyi nachung’ mondo adhodh wuoda to nayudo kotho! To kane anone gi ler mar okinyi ne aneno ni ok en wuowi mane anywolo.”",
    "Dhako machielono nokwer kawacho niya, “Ooyo! Mangimani e wuoda; to mothono e mari.” To dhako mokwongono notwoyo dhoge kawacho niya, “Ooyo! Wuowi mothono e mari; to mangimano to mara.” Omiyo ne gimino wach e nyim ruoth.",
    "Eka ruoth nowacho niya, “Iwacho ni, ‘Wuoda ngima kendo mari otho,’ kendo machielo wacho ni, ‘Ooyo, wuodi otho to mara ngima.’ ”",
    "Eka ruoth nowacho niya, “Kelna ligangla.” Omiyo negikelone ruoth ligangla.",
    "Bang’e nochiwo chik kowacho niya, “Ng’aduru nyathi mangimano e diere ariyo eka umi ng’ato ka ng’ato nus.”",
    "Eka dhako mane wuode ngima nokecho wuode mowacho ni ruoth niya, “Kiyie ruodha, miye nyathino mangimano! Kik inege!” To dhako machielo nowacho niya, “An kata in ok noyud nyathino. Ng’ade nyadiriyo!”",
    "Eka ruoth nong’ado bura kama, “Miuru dhako mokwongono nyathi mangima, kik unege nimar en e min-gi.”",
    "Kane jo-Israel owinjo bura mane ruoth ong’ado, negimiyo ruoth duong’ nikech negineno ne en-gi rieko moa kuom Nyasaye.",
